  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Dealing**: Cards dealt to all players.\n2. **Bidding**: Players bid to determine trump suit or play special contracts.\n3. **Kontra**: Opponents may say 'Kontra' to double the stakes if they believe declarers will fail.\n4. **Trick Play**: Player to dealer's left leads. Must follow suit if possible. If void, may trump or discard.\n5. **Winning Tricks**: Highest trump wins, or highest card of led suit. Winner leads to next trick.",
    Player: "1. **Dealing**: Cards dealt to all players.\n2. **Bidding**: Players bid to determine trump suit or play special contracts.\n3. **Kontra**: Opponents may say 'Kontra' to double the stakes if they believe declarers will fail.\n4. **Trick Play**: Player to dealer's left leads. Must follow suit if possible. If void, may trump or discard.\n5. **Winning Tricks**: Highest trump wins, or highest card of led suit. Winner leads to next trick.",
    objective: 'Win tricks containing high-value cards. Partnership needs majority of points (typically 61+ of 120) to win the hand.',
